{
    "title": "League of Comic Geeks",
    "description": "The League of Comic Geeks app makes it easy to stay on top of the hottest new releases and track your ongoing collection or pull list.\r\n\r\nWith League of Comic Geeks you can:\r\n- Browse recent and upcoming comic book releases, even months out!\r\n- Discover new books with community reviews and discussion\r\n- Catalog your growing comic book collection without limits\r\n- Create and manage a pull list to keep track of your favorites\r\n- Save comics you're missing to your wish list to remember later\r\n- Mark issues read to save your reading progress\r\n- Learn more about thousands of creators and characters\r\n- Search our comic book database containing over 350,000 comics\r\n- Find local comic book stores\r\n\r\nThe Comic Geeks app will periodically sync with your activity from LeagueofComicGeeks.com and vice-versa when connected to a network.\r\n\r\nStay tuned for new, exciting features and improvements!",
    "descriptionHTML": "The League of Comic Geeks app makes it easy to stay on top of the hottest new releases and track your ongoing collection or pull list.<br><br>With League of Comic Geeks you can:<br>- Browse recent and upcoming comic book releases, even months out!<br>- Discover new books with community reviews and discussion<br>- Catalog your growing comic book collection without limits<br>- Create and manage a pull list to keep track of your favorites<br>- Save comics you&#39;re missing to your wish list to remember later<br>- Mark issues read to save your reading progress<br>- Learn more about thousands of creators and characters<br>- Search our comic book database containing over 350,000 comics<br>- Find local comic book stores<br><br>The Comic Geeks app will periodically sync with your activity from LeagueofComicGeeks.com and vice-versa when connected to a network.<br><br>Stay tuned for new, exciting features and improvements!",
